# .dockerignore

# Version control
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# IDE and editor files
**/.vscode
**/.vscode-server
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store

# Python cache and virtual environments
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.Python
**/.env
**/.venv
**/venv/
**/env/
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov

# Node.js
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
**/yarn-error.log
**/.npm
**/.yarn

# Build artifacts and logs
**/dist
**/build
**/*.egg-info
**/logs
**/log
**/*.log

# Docker volumes (if accidentally in project dir)
**/postgres_data
**/redis_data
**/rabbitmq_data
**/opensearch_data
**/loki_data
**/grafana_data

# Documentation and notes that don't need to be in containers
**/notes
**/docs
**/README.md
**/TODO.md
**/todo

# Test files
**/tests
**/*_test.py
**/test_*.py
**/pytest.ini
**/.pytest_cache

# Terraform and infrastructure
**/terraform
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.backup

# Coolify and deployment
**/coolify

# Utilities that don't need to be in images
**/util_scripts
**/setup-aws-dev.ps1

# Migration docs (not needed at runtime)
**/migration_status.md